### Get all workouts
GET http://localhost:5000/workouts

### Add a workout
POST http://localhost:5000/workouts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Leg Day",
  "notes": "Squats felt heavy"
}

### Add a workout with no title (should fail)
POST http://localhost:5000/workouts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "notes": "oops"
}
### Edit workout 2
PUT http://localhost:5000/workouts/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Leg Day (updated)",
  "notes": "Squats felt lighter today"
}

### Delete workout 2
DELETE http://localhost:5000/workouts/2

### Delete a workout that doesn't exist (should fail)
DELETE http://localhost:5000/workouts/999
### Get all exercises
GET http://localhost:5000/exercises

### Add an exercise
POST http://localhost:5000/exercises
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Overhead Press"
}

### Add a duplicate (should fail)
POST http://localhost:5000/exercises
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Squat"
}
### Add Squat (exercise 2) to workout 1
POST http://localhost:5000/workouts/1/exercises
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "exercise_id": 2
}

### Log a set for workout_exercise 2
POST http://localhost:5000/workout-exercises/4/sets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reps": 5,
  "weight": 80
}

### Bad exercise id (should fail)
POST http://localhost:5000/workouts/1/exercises
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "exercise_id": 999
}